    "DefaultText": "Raises your stress levels if not satisfied.\nCan be satisfied by foraging, traveling through muddy areas and eating mushrooms and roots.",
    "Text": "如果得不到满足，将增加你的压力水平。\\n可以通过觅食、穿越泥泞区域、吃蘑菇和各种根类得到满足。",
    "zh": "如果得不到满足，将增加你的压力水平。\\n可以通过觅食、穿越泥泞区域、吃蘑菇和各种根类得到满足。",
    "en": "Raises your stress levels if not satisfied.\\nCan be satisfied by foraging, traveling through muddy areas and eating mushrooms and roots.",
